## Import

Schedules can be imported using their ID:

```shell
terraform import dokploy_schedule.example abc123-schedule-id
```

Or using import blocks (Terraform 1.5+):

```hcl
import {
  to = dokploy_schedule.example
  id = "abc123-schedule-id"
}
```
